# Stable source anchor for compiler-owned cockpit object recipes.
#
# `cockpit.alert`, `cockpit.case`, `cockpit.place`, and `cockpit.event` are
# assembled by the compiler from object(... recipe = stock_ref(...), slots = {...}).
# This file intentionally exports no author-facing UI macro. It is kept in
# stock so repository-local golden fixtures can use a stable include/source
# anchor without copying projection payloads.
#
# Recipes retain thin field/entity/viewpoint/page/component references only.
# Dataset rows, ECharts options, GeoJSON, world geometry, HTML, media payloads,
# and narration scripts stay with their owning subsystems.
